### FengYu plugin build output (plugin-cli / official plugins) ###
# .fyp packages + transient staging/zip siblings produced by `fengyu plugin build`
**/dist-package/
**/.staging-*/
**/*.tmp-*
# Per-ui lockfile fingerprint written by ensureUiInstalled()
**/node_modules/.fengyu-lock-hash

# Local checkout of the plugin STORE repository (www.infinia.fyi) kept beside the
# app for development — official plugins never live in this repo (store-distributed).
/OfficialPlugins/

### Local agent / IDE tool configs ###
.codex/

### Stray local dev / build artifacts (sources live under toolchain/) ###
# Tauri (Rust) shell was removed in favor of Electron (commit 8d5c7935);
# src-tauri/ is leftover and can reappear from an old toolchain on disk.
/desktop/src-tauri/
# electron-builder output (unpacked app, icon cache, builder-debug.yml).
# Regenerated by `npm run build`/release; never commit it.
/desktop/dist-electron/
# Local npm-install copies of the plugin toolchain packages. Canonical sources
# are toolchain/sdk-ts, toolchain/ui, toolchain/dev — never these root mirrors.
/plugin-sdk/
/plugin-ui/
/plugin-dev/
/plugin-cli/
.firecrawl/

# Ad-hoc screenshots from live GUI patrol sessions (kept on disk, never source).
/gui-test-screenshots/

# Python bytecode from local SDK test runs (__pycache__ is never source).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local review-evidence capture (logs, probes) — archive outside the repo.
review-evidence-*/

# Promotional video assets (raw clips/stills/exports), not part of the source tree.
/promo/

# ZCode agent session state (plans/logs) — machine-local, never source.
.zcode/

# Host SPA convenience copy for IDE classpath serving; the shaded JAR bundles
# frontend/dist directly (FengYu pom). Regenerate: cd frontend && yarn build.
FengYu/src/main/resources/static/

# Internal design mockups carrying local copies of Aceternity UI sources (their
# license forbids redistributing source files) plus built dist artifacts — kept
# local-only; never track them in this public repository.
design-mockups/plugin-templates/
